{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "75fa60bcb756f98a5718cd1573a440d6506676bded827525f068405973544332", "ja": "幕間勝負？　頑固店長とアイドル！", "zh": "幕间较量？顽固店长与偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6b37a85542803e747801e1f54af7e7d8aed5f016b09c0a0a346d6910a63fb189", "ja": "今回のグルメ対決、お題は『お弁当』。オー\nプニングを撮影し終えた風花と紬は、自分達\nが担当するお店の店長に手伝いを申し出る。\n冷めた態度を見せる店長だったが、ふたりの\n真面目な仕事ぶりに、打ち解けていく。", "zh": "这次的美食对决，主题是“便当”。拍摄完开\n场部分后，风花和紬主动提出要帮忙照看自己\n负责的店铺。店长们一开始态度冷淡，但在看\n到两人认真工作的模样后，也逐渐和她们熟络起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "a3b5f8cf9da3cf5fa43780cbd633b0170a1ee1762da04ee6f9da345b23539711", "ja": "紬＆風花チーム", "zh": "紬＆风花队", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cc6ff320135090e4d8308536c0192517503854097fb73e76b2ac692c50a72d8f", "ja": "……というわけで。私たちは今、\n大阪駅に来ています。なぜここなのか、というと……？", "zh": "……总而言之，我们现在\n来到了大阪站。要问为什么选在这里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "44041e3d5f0e50d4449ce151cd1799379953ea50a3c34d4708692382fdb2188b", "ja": "はい、今回私たちが応援するグルメに関係あるんです。\n駅でグルメと言えば……？　そう、お弁当！", "zh": "没错，这次我们要支持的美食就和这个有关。\n说到车站美食……对了，就是便当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6dfcbf29d421fd6cdbb930f8454c46ace010dfa593a37776cf1a510e2f7729cd", "ja": "お弁当、いいですよね……。\n私たちも現場やロケで、よくいただきますし。", "zh": "便当很不错呢……  \n我们在现场或外景拍摄时，也经常能吃到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4f51d856c4a3d631efde5482d45bf445f22157014f05762b63b294501b7f64d8", "ja": "そうそう、ロケ弁ってわくわくするよね♪\n今回お世話になるお店も、すっごく美味しそうで……。", "zh": "对对，外景便当总是让人很期待呢♪\n这次要承蒙关照的店，看起来也特别好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ed0bc8812c3a576688bb267834665b3af0a3602466e41c754e4cff10593137e1", "ja": "駅構内に番組の特別ブースが設置されているので、\nさっそく向かってみたいと思います！　楽しみ～♪", "zh": "车站里设置了节目的特别展台，\n我想马上过去看看！好期待～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "949170364aa828159001ff6d3af8d5a2af9f2db573ae15316fbb8cdd05cc6b08", "ja": "それでは……。\n『バズ飯、椀オン椀』、開幕です。", "zh": "那么……《话题美食，碗上加碗》，现在开幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "19bd59d1eb28b2c4790b429f322a5ecaa9e3575125fe15f1dffa57df56520735", "ja": "ふたりともお疲れさま。\nオープニングのシーン、バッチリだったな！", "zh": "你们两个都辛苦了。\n开场的场景，表现得非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2267a19a0f8652f4763f1f85ea66cc185eb889e6adf9cf8dd0fd9ccbbdfdefe9", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nすみません、今日の撮影は、これで全部ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n不好意思，今天的拍摄到这里就全部结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ee4cb015fe04ac0eb3e62b2a5323838add05e2519470cdb1a6b6b1400bd27d1e", "ja": "うん？　そうだな。後は弁当屋の店長さんと、\n軽く顔合わせをするくらいだけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？是啊。之后就和便当店的店长简单见个面……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d7021b029563d5ceb05c77181b2249fc8258b3b3c1f4d7b0154f829d8caee1ad", "ja": "あ、ええと……私と紬ちゃんで話したんですけど、\nちょっとお願いがあって……。", "zh": "啊，那个……我和紬商量了一下，有件事想拜托您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b2d6ccc015bdc40d3b7e48a367685c9681435c3fa9e81f06ecadfa58b1293837", "ja": "店長さん、すみません！\nちょっと今、お時間いただいてもよろしいですか？", "zh": "店长，打扰一下！\n请问现在能耽误您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1012_tencho", "source_sha256": "78f4855222ae8e744f1df4e0b1d3277ed952164824b4ce97e0ec649b0d2be5f4", "ja": "……ん？　ああ、あんたらは……。", "zh": "……嗯？啊，是你们啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9596500581b01c5f369785cb97b125380592faf5ed4fbe69b78aeef1ea1eefa3", "ja": "お疲れさまです。この度、アンバサダーを務めさせて\nいただくことになりました。765プロの白石紬です。", "zh": "辛苦了。这次我有幸担任大使。我是765事务所的白石紬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1db4d92bb73ad5cf781ab29968b784f45539608af6d69eba1bffa9902a102bf0", "ja": "同じく、豊川風花です。お力になれるように、\n精一杯頑張りますので、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我也是，我是丰川风花。为了能帮上忙，\n我会全力以赴的，请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1015_tencho", "source_sha256": "7ea3c44dda249706edf15ce1ae37a3f0e36b0694fdabe706efc5624b033b9eaa", "ja": "はいはい……まあ、よろしく。\n店はこっちでやるんで、適当に賑やかしてくれれば。", "zh": "好的好的……那就拜托了。\n店里的事由我来做，你只要随便热闹一下就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6482b36beb49c722f116d7f40938ae4440577213257df11d92d89f8af6b98699", "ja": "ああ……ええと、それなんですが\nうちの豊川と白石から、ご提案がありまして。", "zh": "啊……那个，是这样的，\n我们这边的丰川和白石有个提议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d9c5ae277939505a2d0c0923053bd7545df7651827f09bce0baea96250293fcd", "ja": "はい、あの……できたら、\n私たちにお店の手伝いをさせて欲しいんです！", "zh": "是的，那个……如果可以的话，希望能让我们帮忙打理店铺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "377c8ac8b10398940064e67e95400b9416db3508c66306b16ff9c2878de1d5b6", "ja": "それほど長い時間は取れないので、\n申し訳ないのですが……よろしければ、是非。", "zh": "因为抽不出太长时间，\n很抱歉……如果您不介意的话，还请务必让我们帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1019_tencho", "source_sha256": "a4863f5f964e4fd73bc81d3756658556e333ced9fc69febdead7439502a29314", "ja": "なんでそんな……ああ、なるほど。好感度アップの\nアピールってわけか。大変やね、アイドルさんも……。", "zh": "为什么要那样……啊，原来如此。是为了提升好感度的表现啊。偶像也真是不容易……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "15584acb7167ae09c3a204f77b8ba0d07d6d873c2bc45ce891a44b79e26e5fad", "ja": "い、いえ、そうではなく……！\n知りたいのです。こちらのお弁当のことを。", "zh": "不、不是那样的……！\n我是想了解。关于这里的便当的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "69c4a1d1a05b3de1edc576b1202410d587b61de5dc3ad71e5df8d57b32eb9545", "ja": "どんな思いでお店をやられているのか。とか。\nちゃんと応援させていただくために。", "zh": "比如，您是抱着怎样的心情经营这家店的。为了让我好好支持您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1022_tencho", "source_sha256": "e56d4f430519687626093328a9fd77a579b1c98e63c90499414938d46aee1d4f", "ja": "ふーん……まあ、お好きにどうぞ。\nただ、かき入れ時は邪魔せんといてくださいよ？", "zh": "嗯……随你便吧。不过，生意最忙的时候，还请别来碍事哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8f728ff5938e275c5fd140075a42698bef33cf81051c9ed048087968311f9b0f", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！　頑張ります！", "zh": "啊，谢谢！我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1025_okyakusantati", "source_sha256": "90e63106a35d36e7854632ebf11b1115fabf94c9b1d0d99343839800d38c9036", "ja": "ざわざわ、ざわざわ……。", "zh": "窸窸窣窣，窸窸窣窣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "65274cae11d9f3d35e0ef63e510cb27eed090c97ee0ce069065230b73eaa3475", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ。\nご注文、お決まりでしたらどうぞ。", "zh": "欢迎光临。\n决定好点什么的话，请随时告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1027_kyaku", "source_sha256": "3af4dfaf6838129225dbe72b7ba1bd802e8da33350d852e6291ca9b59530d870", "ja": "すみませーん、この、今日の日替わりってなんですか？", "zh": "不好意思，请问今天的特供是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "759f52eaebce39c5b245e373750710d5e19f852d449c36768f91b3f710380c49", "ja": "そちらは、幕の内弁当です。ボリュームたっぷり、\n栄養バランスもよくて、オススメですよ。", "zh": "那是幕之内便当。分量十足，营养均衡，很推荐哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1029_kyaku", "source_sha256": "cb07ff1d0644bc06a9b435f6fabd417bf476852a10a78ee2996bc411dcbc2f3f", "ja": "おーい！　こっちの唐揚げ弁当、まだー！？", "zh": "喂！这边的炸鸡便当还没好吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3042e5c4cc90f399b92260511b77663e6a29208fc4edffcc9030d969d7eee6d6", "ja": "あ、ええと……すみません、\n揚げているところですので、もう少し……。", "zh": "啊，那个……不好意思，正在炸，还请再稍等一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ab05b7509b5a54f3c75cd2637ab231a9ff2a8951d6f60a17a32c650ab1090155", "ja": "紬ちゃん、はいこれ！　先の方のご注文。\nおしぼりとお箸、もう入ってるから。", "zh": "紬，这个给你！是前面的订单。湿毛巾和筷子已经放进去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4cb2f9ce17d48ceb482aab3d4d38024032e2c8f18ba3183b49c21cfe5c60f3a9", "ja": "助かります、豊川さん……！\n大変、お待たせしました。こちらどうぞ。", "zh": "谢谢你，丰川小姐……！让您久等了。给，请拿好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5048fb31157dcf1eaefceeccc02343aaf2724303ba26025d712870045fbd5671", "ja": "っと、そろそろお箸がなくなりそう……？\n店長さん私、取ってきますね！　容器も要りますか？", "zh": "啊，筷子好像快没了……？\n店长，我去拿过来吧！需要容器吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1034_tencho", "source_sha256": "4e897a7c73991d146d35650570aed33cab0501abd7cd2683e408e852e1ff1d7a", "ja": "あ、ああ……よろしく。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "edd6dc19bf58df3a0c690e13f97f551699c48c32c9cbd9b6a0112d6c92d99467", "ja": "ふぅ……お疲れさまでした。\n電車のダイヤ次第で、かなり混雑しますね……。", "zh": "呼……辛苦了。\n根据电车时刻表的情况，车厢里会相当拥挤呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8a12cc2453b6296570c13c3715471df29b2befd3c4fc800e9365f3e246b7a0c3", "ja": "なんだか、ずっとバタバタしちゃってたね。\nすみません、店長さん。あまりお役に立てなくて。", "zh": "总觉得一直都忙忙乱乱的呢。\n对不起，店长，没能帮上什么忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1037_tencho", "source_sha256": "e51935b505334eb124b2b4ec65b4eab771d0a1643693600ad5a16e8e670c11b8", "ja": "いや……こっちこそ、スマンかった。\n正直あんたらのこと、色眼鏡で見てたよ。", "zh": "不……我这边才该说抱歉。\n老实说，我之前一直戴着有色眼镜看你们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1038_tencho", "source_sha256": "4c0ad9d3ec433a879f618af477c36290ff6e80147ae668f68f7d82f201bb2ca5", "ja": "けど……仕事ぶり見たら、真剣だってわかった。\nありがとうな。", "zh": "不过……看到你的工作态度后，我就知道你是认真的。\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "faf1f1920d42372a915fc037b9b708fb08898177affdf9037d2c17e485f0fa25", "ja": "いえ、そんな！　お礼なんて……。\n無理言って、やらせてもらったのはこっちですから。", "zh": "不会，哪里的话！用不着向我道谢……\n硬是拜托您让我来做这件事的，本来也是我呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1040_tencho", "source_sha256": "d3d8026ee1569440a05ef1e5835b3d71f84e1c3242b837ec664987edf380c5ca", "ja": "……。うち、父子家庭でなぁ。\n子ども達の弁当、ずっと俺が作っててん。", "zh": "……。我家是单亲家庭，只有我和父亲。\n孩子们平时的便当，一直都是我来做的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1041_tencho", "source_sha256": "d9795e48098b1bd5383190bbcd7f926d21f52e55b146c071bd9c5427d3b52c21", "ja": "そしたら、父ちゃんの弁当美味しいから、\nお店やったらええやん！　って言ってくれてな。", "zh": "然后，她还对我说，爸爸做的便当很好吃，开个店不就好了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9e1dfa0c61e0a152a3b1f119589fe80afb4f978d9348c3bfd785d6d36a59da0d", "ja": "わぁ、そうだったんですね……！\nお子さん達の気持ち、わかるなぁ……。", "zh": "哇，原来是这样啊……！\n我能理解孩子们的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1043_tencho", "source_sha256": "ca9cc9c7b4a82ca9549f50a180086448a6e82b8e08603b65ec07e769be8c965a", "ja": "まっ、そんなわけで、弁当屋やっとんねん。\n知りたいって言ってくれたけど、つまらん話やろ！", "zh": "嘛，就是这么回事，我现在经营着一家便当店。\n你说想知道来着，但这故事挺无聊的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1044_051tmg", "source_sha256": "32745b5256a9809a462be80a94aec626c940bc94f88ea804fc9ae688279b03de", "ja": "いえ、ちっとも……。\n話してくれて、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "不会，一点也不无聊……\n谢谢您愿意跟我讲这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1045_tencho", "source_sha256": "840fa4fc9680117cd150799eeb2238355324173b9a00326c132c3d1380c54a65", "ja": "はは……っと、あんたら忙しいんやったな。はよ帰り。\n後はひとりでやっとくから。お疲れさん。", "zh": "哈哈……对了，你们还忙着呢。快回去吧。\n剩下的我一个人来就行。辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "482da0f260a925381ab9361c0c65000877280a52a1b1259135131738076b67a2", "ja": "紬ちゃん？　{$P$}さん、\nもうすぐ着くって。", "zh": "小紬？{$P$}先生说，马上就到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1047_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0b8b24bfd78eb02551564020e882a881ccb6021147ce454dab8f745f4068fd68", "ja": "はい……。\nあの、豊川さん。あの店長さん、いい方でしたね。", "zh": "是……那个，丰川小姐。那位店长人真好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1048_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c915916ba4d6d6ca7bfef12dfd7b0ee01258126051272ed11ea5d4e42efce958", "ja": "うん。……ねえ、紬ちゃん。\n勝ちたいね。", "zh": "嗯。……那个，紬。\n好想赢啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_03_1049_051tmg", "source_sha256": "301a3259a7a79876ceca86bad50c986507822470d98bebdd3f3273c7cf7bec49", "ja": "はい。……本番、頑張りましょう。", "zh": "嗯。……正式演出时，我们一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
